<title>UK: UBS sets warrants on Clariant shares.</title>
<headline>UBS sets warrants on Clariant shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland, Zurich said it has issued five million American-style call warrants, on Clariant registered share.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    525 CHF		   PREMIUM	9.60 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     4.50 CHF		  GEARING	11.5 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	16.JAN.98		 PAYDATE	20.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXERCISE 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  520 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
